# CommandLayer environment configuration (all optional).
#
# CommandLayer ships fully functional with zero configuration: the
# built-in local mock provider serves all reasoning requests.
#
# To route reasoning through a real AI provider, deploy a Secure
# Intelligence Gateway that implements POST /v1/reason (see README,
# "Secure Intelligence Gateway contract") and point this variable at it.
#
# SECURITY: the extension stores NO provider secrets. Provider API keys
# belong ONLY in the gateway's server-side configuration. Never add
# VITE_*_API_KEY variables here.
#
# HTTPS is required (plain HTTP is accepted only for localhost
# development). No path, query, or fragment.
VITE_AI_GATEWAY_URL=
